                    "sense_id": "f06e965c-62a7-344e-8222-b5a8a63e3a08",
                    "sense_definition": "Causing strong feelings of disgust or being very unpleasant.",
                    "learner_level": "A2",
                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "disgusting",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "I found a <w>gross</w> hair in my soup and immediately lost my appetite.",
